{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Two worlds! Two fates! One man who can change it all!\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/extras/pm_1.png?t=1753120131\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i> </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Features</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>1000+ beautiful 3D-rendered CG content</strong> depicting the story rendered in sharp, <strong>crisp 4K resolution</strong> for the <strong>highest quality</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>29 stunning animations including variants</strong>, showing fights, action, and drama with fluid, smooth movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 A sprawling, world-spanning story with engaging themes of trauma and past mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Three main routes</strong>, each with their own unique characters, story beats, and endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Many branching pathways and alternate endings</strong> along the story paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Immersive, original music tracks</strong> masterfully composed to enhance your gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/extras/pm_5.png?t=1753120131\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cyrus is in a transitional point of his life, mired in past mistakes, fractured relationships and unresolved trauma. While attempting to restart his life in a new city with a new job, he is thrust into the fantasy world of Cadagan, tasked with taking down the evil insurgent king Monn Molian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/extras/pm_2.png?t=1753120131\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The catch? Due to a mishap in the spell bringing him to Cadagan, Cyrus is now tethered to both worlds, forcing him to alternate days between each and overcome his seemingly-insurmountable and conflicting priorities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/extras/pm_3.png?t=1753120131\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And of course, that isn't the last spanner in the works, with a girl from a long-gone, highly turbulent relationship suddenly reappearing in his life. With a rare second chance to restart and rebuild, Cyrus will take charge, address his past mistakes and seize his bright new future. Or, at least, he hopes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/extras/pm_4.png?t=1753120131\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3302660?t=1753120131","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753120131","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/dae7bcb739fa77eae121435dcd449918a5979144/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753120131","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/dae7bcb739fa77eae121435dcd449918a5979144/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753120131","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Contains implicit references to sexual relations, characters' appearances and bodies. All characters in this game are adults aged 18 or over. Mature themes in the story of all versions include past trauma and dysfunctional relationship dynamics. Frequent profanity is present in the script. Violence is present in the script and renders, and dangerous combat is described and rendered accurately."},"demos":[{"appid":3741780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Two worlds! Two fates! One man who can change it all!\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302660/extras/pm_1.png?t=1753120131\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i> </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Features</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>1000+ beautiful 3D-rendered CG content</strong> depi